OL,3,GNEWSAHospital entrance and parking get
OL,4,A#3.7m facelift
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #3.7m scheme to refurbish the main
OL,7,Fentrance to the Queen's Medical Centre
OL,8,F(QMC) in Nottingham, which will see
OL,9,Fadjacent parking reorganised, has
OL,10,Fbegun.
OL,12,FMajor structural maintenance is needed
OL,13,Fto make the area waterproof, protect
OL,14,Fthe A&E department below, and have the
OL,15,Ftwo bridges leading to it strengthened.
OL,17,FAlongside this, the scheme includes
OL,18,Fredesigned car parking, new drop off
OL,19,Fspaces, a refurbished canopy cover for
OL,20,Fpedestrians, new secure bicycle
OL,21,Fstorage, and a new main entrance lobby.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
